        "type": "text",
        "text": "填空题：12. $y = \\frac{1}{\\mathrm{e}} x$ ， $y = -\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{e}} x$ 13.-3 14. $[\\frac{3}{2e},1)$",
        "bbox": [
